  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Togo: Facilitation d&apos;un meilleur  acc&#xE8;s aux march&#xE9;s internationaux &#x2013; (AMI Commerce Togo)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMI Togo project aims to improve trade by reducing barriers and enhancing transparency. It has three key outcomes:Identifying and reducing trade obstacles through stakeholder engagement and prioritization.Strengthening Togo&amp;apos;s trade obstacle resolution mechanism (MAOC).Facilitating international trade for Togolese SMEs through a trade facilitation portal (PFE) and simplifying administrative procedures.The project seeks to create a more efficient and accessible trade environment, benefiting Togo&amp;apos;s private sector and promoting economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
